<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>If Only With You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Rocco</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">If Only With You</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2PIvjua6UjS2tnPHXLCNn5</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.137" end="00:13.981">You kissed me then you had to leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.981" end="00:21.981">No I can't stop thinking of you, of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.461" end="00:25.305">You left behind your favorite ring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.305" end="00:33.185">I guess I have to give it to you soon, to you soon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.185" end="00:34.685" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.186" end="00:39.351">Now I am waiting patiently like a puppet on a string</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.351" end="00:45.034">You do as you will and I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.034" end="00:50.646">I see you in everything, want a house up on the hill</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.646" end="00:54.951">Is that too much to ask, girl is it right?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.951" end="00:56.451" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.952" end="01:00.548">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.548" end="01:06.194">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.194" end="01:11.827">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.827" end="01:18.412">If only with you, with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.412" end="01:19.912" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.862" end="01:21.868">We met up in a parking lot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.868" end="01:24.547">Listening to her silent thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.547" end="01:30.217">With open arms you take me as a fool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.217" end="01:33.089">You said you have somewhere to go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.089" end="01:35.869">I wonder if she even knows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.869" end="01:40.973">I like it when I have something to prove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.973" end="01:42.473" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.974" end="01:47.100">Now I am waiting patiently like a puppet on a string</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.100" end="01:52.785">You do as you will, and I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.785" end="01:58.381">I see you in everything, want a house up on the hill</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.381" end="02:02.755">Is that too much to ask, girl is it right?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.755" end="02:04.255" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.756" end="02:08.250">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.250" end="02:13.913">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.913" end="02:19.564">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.564" end="02:25.280">If only with you, with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.280" end="02:28.290">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.290" end="02:29.790" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.291" end="02:30.915">You held my hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.915" end="02:33.775">The lights turned down low</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.775" end="02:36.592">I didn't say much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.592" end="02:39.525">Cause you had to go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.525" end="02:47.525">I'm here where I stand, where the flowers grow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.858" end="02:49.358" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.859" end="02:53.444">If only in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.444" end="02:59.125">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.125" end="03:04.770">If only with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.770" end="03:10.426">If only with you, with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.426" end="03:14.426">If only with you</p></div></body></tt>